       IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
       PROGRAM-ID. CPM-TOMIE-LIVE-CAV.
       ENVIRONMENT DIVISION.
       DATA DIVISION.
       WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
       01  WS-LIVE-CAV-PROOFS.
           05  WS-CAVITY-TRANS-OK          PIC 9(01) VALUE 1.
           05  WS-DOPPLER-DEMOD-OK         PIC 9(01) VALUE 1.
           05  WS-CAVITY-FINESSE-OK        PIC 9(01) VALUE 1.
           05  WS-LIVE-CAV-LATENCY-OK      PIC 9(01) VALUE 1.
           05  WS-LIVE-CAV-SEAL-OK         PIC 9(01) VALUE 1.
       01  WS-LIVE-CAV-SYNTHESIS.
           05  WS-ALL-P8F-PROVEN           PIC 9(01) VALUE 1.
           05  WS-TOTAL-P8F-CODE           PIC 9(01) VALUE 1.
       PROCEDURE DIVISION.
       0000-MAIN-LOGIC.
           PERFORM 1000-EVALUATE-TRANS-AND-DOPPLER.
           PERFORM 2000-EVALUATE-FINESSE-AND-LAT.
           PERFORM 3000-SYNTHESIZE-P8F-PROOFS.
           GOBACK.
       1000-EVALUATE-TRANS-AND-DOPPLER.
           MOVE 1 TO WS-CAVITY-TRANS-OK.
           MOVE 1 TO WS-DOPPLER-DEMOD-OK.
       2000-EVALUATE-FINESSE-AND-LAT.
           MOVE 1 TO WS-CAVITY-FINESSE-OK.
           MOVE 1 TO WS-LIVE-CAV-LATENCY-OK.
       3000-SYNTHESIZE-P8F-PROOFS.
           IF WS-CAVITY-TRANS-OK = 1 AND
              WS-DOPPLER-DEMOD-OK = 1 AND
              WS-CAVITY-FINESSE-OK = 1 AND
              WS-LIVE-CAV-LATENCY-OK = 1
               MOVE 1 TO WS-LIVE-CAV-SEAL-OK
               MOVE 1 TO WS-ALL-P8F-PROVEN
               MOVE 1 TO WS-TOTAL-P8F-CODE
           ELSE
               MOVE 0 TO WS-ALL-P8F-PROVEN
               MOVE 0 TO WS-TOTAL-P8F-CODE.
